From: ButlerX <butlerx@localhost>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 07:00:00 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] qca-nss-ecm: declare external AE selector prototype

GCC 14 enables missing-prototypes diagnostics for the example module.  The
selector is intentionally exported through the public AE callback interface,
so declare it in the public header rather than making the definition static.

---
 exports/ecm_ae_classifier_public.h | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

--- a/exports/ecm_ae_classifier_public.h
+++ b/exports/ecm_ae_classifier_public.h
@@ -76,6 +76,11 @@ struct ecm_ae_classifier_info {
 	uint16_t flag;				/**< Flow type flag. */
 };
 
+/**
+ * Select the acceleration engine for a flow.
+ */
+ecm_ae_classifier_result_t ecm_ae_select(struct ecm_ae_classifier_info *info);
+
 /**
 * ECM AE classifier results.
 */
